---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Jason Tu studies mathematics and data analytics at The Ohio State University and works on dynamical systems, Rust infrastructure, and Apple apps."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm Jason Tu, an undergraduate at The Ohio State University studying
      mathematics (honors, theory track) and data analytics.
    </p>
    <p>
      My work runs along three lines. In research, I co-authored{' '}
      <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.18426"
        >A Relative Variational Principle for Expanding Iterated Function
        Systems</a
      >, published on arXiv in August 2026. In open source, I have 38 merged
      pull requests into{' '}
      <a href="https://github.com/fds-pmine/hotaru_mqtt">hotaru_mqtt</a> and its
      parent Rust web framework{' '}
      <a href="https://github.com/Field-of-Dream-Studio/hotaru">hotaru</a>,
      covering MQTT v5 wire format and version negotiation, a runtime-agnostic
      core, a no_std port, and broker hardening. I have had write access since
      August 2026. In software, I build apps for Apple platforms:{' '}
      <a
        href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/scritto-%E8%A8%80%E5%BD%95/id6787353058"
        >Scritto</a
      >, on-device transcription and translation;{' '}
      <a
        href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/easyreminder-ics/id6789404034"
        >EasyReminder ICS</a
      >; and{' '}
      <a
        href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/%E8%85%95%E8%AF%AD/id6787396039"
        >腕语</a
      >. All are free on the App Store.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="about-aside" aria-labelledby="elsewhere">
    <h2 class="group-title" id="elsewhere">Elsewhere</h2>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="https://github.com/Jason25417">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.18426">arXiv</a></li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/developer/id6785333743"
          >App Store developer page</a
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
